      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table\ncommences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with\ncolumn 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nCommencement information\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nProvisions\nCommencement\nDate/Details",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table\ncommences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with\ncolumn 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nCommencement information\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nProvisions\nCommencement\nDate/Details",
