      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The purpose of the report is to provide updated costings in relation\nto the amount of the base component specified in\nparagraph 12(1)(a) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge\nAct, using the same model and methodology that was previously\nused to determine that amount but taking into account changes to\ninputs and assumptions that have occurred since that amount was\nfirst determined.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The purpose of the report is to provide updated costings in relation\nto the amount of the base component specified in\nparagraph 12(1)(a) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge\nAct, using the same model and methodology that was previously\nused to determine that amount but taking into account changes to\ninputs and assumptions that have occurred since that amount was\nfirst determined.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0aa9a3e6a191ec4f91dfa2239f529d3219a216de62999d6616986d91f83582f4",
      "skos:note": "Purpose of report is to provide updated costings for the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(2) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The purpose of the report is to provide updated costings in relation\nto the amount of the base component specified in\nparagraph 12(1)(a) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge\nAct, using the same model and methodology that was previously\nused to determine that amount but taking into account changes to\ninputs and assumptions that have occurred since that amount was\nfirst determined."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-2-norm",
