      "values:originalText": "(4) The report must specify the aggregated data inputs and the\nmodelling assumptions upon which the estimates referred to in\nsubsection (3) were determined.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The report must specify the aggregated data inputs and the\nmodelling assumptions upon which the estimates referred to in\nsubsection (3) were determined.",
      "values:partOf": {
