    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(5) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In preparing the report, the ACCC:\n\n(a) must use the methodology and model that was used by the\nDepartment of Communications and the Arts’ Bureau of\nCommunications Research for the report entitled NBN\nnon-commercial services funding options—Final report\nMarch 2016; but\n\n(b) must, in doing so, update the inputs and assumptions of the\nmethodology and model to reflect changes that have occurred\nsince the publication of that report.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In preparing the report, the ACCC:\n\n(a) must use the methodology and model that was used by the\nDepartment of Communications and the Arts’ Bureau of\nCommunications Research for the report entitled NBN\nnon-commercial services funding options—Final report\nMarch 2016; but\n\n(b) must, in doing so, update the inputs and assumptions of the\nmethodology and model to reflect changes that have occurred\nsince the publication of that report.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
