        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-5-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6099102dbb18e837a1b075d0c04b646b7f056538b7f72700f785ea757ab0257a",
      "skos:note": "Must use methodology and model from March 2016 report, updating inputs and assumptions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(5) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In preparing the report, the ACCC:\n\n(a) must use the methodology and model that was used by the\nDepartment of Communications and the Arts’ Bureau of\nCommunications Research for the report entitled NBN\nnon-commercial services funding options—Final report\nMarch 2016; but\n\n(b) must, in doing so, update the inputs and assumptions of the\nmethodology and model to reflect changes that have occurred\nsince the publication of that report."
    },
