    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(6) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Without limiting paragraph (5)(b), the following are changes that\nmust be taken into account in updating the inputs and assumptions:\n\n(a) changes in the inputs for estimating the total number of\nchargeable premises by reference to which charge is imposed\nby the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act;\n\n(b) changes in the inputs for build costs in relation to fixed\nwireless broadband and satellite broadband matters;\n\n(c) changes in the inputs for estimating future capital\nexpenditure requirements in relation to fixed wireless\nbroadband and satellite broadband matters.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Without limiting paragraph (5)(b), the following are changes that\nmust be taken into account in updating the inputs and assumptions:\n\n(a) changes in the inputs for estimating the total number of\nchargeable premises by reference to which charge is imposed\nby the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act;\n\n(b) changes in the inputs for build costs in relation to fixed\nwireless broadband and satellite broadband matters;\n\n(c) changes in the inputs for estimating future capital\nexpenditure requirements in relation to fixed wireless\nbroadband and satellite broadband matters.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-6-norm"
        },
