    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(7) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(7) In preparing the report, the ACCC must assume that Division 6 of\nPart 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and\nService Standards) Act 1999 had not been enacted.\nNote:\nThat Division deals with charge offset certificates."
    },
