      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(8) Before the end of the 150-day period beginning when this section\ncommences, the ACCC must:\n\n\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(a) give the Minister the report; and\n\n(b) make the report available on the ACCC’s website.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) Before the end of the 150-day period beginning when this section\ncommences, the ACCC must:\n\n\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(a) give the Minister the report; and\n\n(b) make the report available on the ACCC’s website.",
