    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(10) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(10) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in this section does\nnot limit:\n\n(a) subsection 80(1) of the Telecommunications (Consumer\nProtection and Service Standards) Act 1999; or\n\n(b) subsection 13(3) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge\nAct.\nDefinitions",
      "skos:definition": "(10) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in this section does\nnot limit:\n\n(a) subsection 80(1) of the Telecommunications (Consumer\nProtection and Service Standards) Act 1999; or\n\n(b) subsection 13(3) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge\nAct.\nDefinitions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-10-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "11e98b42ac162333134ada532fadf909da6aa19570cd049349dd90f08643dc72",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from definition of 'Regional' for specific Acts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(10) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(10) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in this section does\nnot limit:\n\n(a) subsection 80(1) of the Telecommunications (Consumer\nProtection and Service Standards) Act 1999; or\n\n(b) subsection 13(3) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge\nAct.\nDefinitions"
    },
