    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(11) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sec-5-2-ss-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(11) In this section:\nfixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters means\nthe matters referred to in paragraphs 13(3)(a) to (d) of the Regional\nBroadband Scheme Charge Act.\nMinister means the Minister administering the\nTelecommunications Act 1997.\nNBN Co has the same meaning as in the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011.\nRegional Broadband Scheme means the scheme embodied in:\n\n(a) Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and\nService Standards) Act 1999; and\n\n(b) the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act.\nRegional Broadband Scheme Charge Act means the\nTelecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act\n2020.\n\nLayer 2 bitstream services  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(11) In this section:\nfixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters means\nthe matters referred to in paragraphs 13(3)(a) to (d) of the Regional\nBroadband Scheme Charge Act.\nMinister means the Minister administering the\nTelecommunications Act 1997.\nNBN Co has the same meaning as in the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011.\nRegional Broadband Scheme means the scheme embodied in:\n\n(a) Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and\nService Standards) Act 1999; and\n\n(b) the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act.\nRegional Broadband Scheme Charge Act means the\nTelecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act\n2020.\n\nLayer 2 bitstream services  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
