      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a local access line is a line that is part\nof the infrastructure of a local access network.\n\nSchedule 1  Layer 2 bitstream services",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a local access line is a line that is part\nof the infrastructure of a local access network.\n\nSchedule 1  Layer 2 bitstream services",
