    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-1-sec-27",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "27 Transitional—exemptions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-1-sec-27"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(1) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(1) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to section 141 of that Act\nwere a reference to section 143 of that Act.\n(2)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(2) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(2) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to section 141 of that Act\nwere a reference to section 143 of that Act.\n(3)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(3) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(3) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to subsections 141(2) and (3)\nof that Act were a reference to subsection 143(2) of that Act.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(1) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(1) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to section 141 of that Act\nwere a reference to section 143 of that Act.\n(2)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(2) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(2) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to section 141 of that Act\nwere a reference to section 143 of that Act.\n(3)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(3) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(3) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to subsections 141(2) and (3)\nof that Act were a reference to subsection 143(2) of that Act.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-1-sec-27-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "573a6df4f619274e8af2cd2a45c64fc23a6c04d695b1abaa34f8dcdfe4aed893",
      "skos:note": "Preserves effect of existing instruments under subsections 141A(1), 141A(2), and 141A(3) of the Telecommunications Act 1997."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-1-sec-27",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "27 Transitional—exemptions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(1) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(1) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to section 141 of that Act\nwere a reference to section 143 of that Act.\n(2)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(2) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(2) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to section 141 of that Act\nwere a reference to section 143 of that Act.\n(3)\nIf, immediately before the commencement of this item, an instrument\nwas in force under subsection 141A(3) of the Telecommunications Act\n1997, the instrument has effect, after the commencement of this item, as\nif:\n\n(a) it had been made under subsection 144(3) of that Act; and\n\n(b) each reference in the instrument to subsections 141(2) and (3)\nof that Act were a reference to subsection 143(2) of that Act.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020"
    },
