      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) A reference in paragraph (1)(c) to a functional separation\nundertaking given by a carrier is a reference to a functional\nseparation undertaking given by the carrier either:\n\n(a) alone; or\n\n(b) jointly with one or more other persons.\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(2) A reference in paragraph (1)(c) to a functional separation\nundertaking given by a carrier is a reference to a functional\nseparation undertaking given by the carrier either:\n\n(a) alone; or\n\n(b) jointly with one or more other persons.\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2b36791a372a3c5043a2214180b8967bf0c63050ec23f26705ae63ade7ef6d60",
      "skos:note": "Functional separation undertaking given by a carrier"
    },
    {
