    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-32",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32 Section 142A",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-32"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\nwholesale business unit of a corporation means a business unit by\nwhich the corporation deals with its wholesale customers, and its\nretail business unit, in relation to the supply of local access line\nservices.\nwholesale customer means a customer that is:\n\n(a) a carrier; or\n\n(b) a service provider.\nwholesaler, when used in relation to a joint functional separation\nundertaking, means a person identified in the undertaking as the\nwholesaler, or one of the wholesalers, for the purposes of the\nundertaking.\nNote:\nSee paragraph 151C(2)(a).\nworker means an individual who is:\n\n(a) an employee; or\n\n(b) a contractor or subcontractor; or\n\n(c) an employee of a contractor or subcontractor.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\nwholesale business unit of a corporation means a business unit by\nwhich the corporation deals with its wholesale customers, and its\nretail business unit, in relation to the supply of local access line\nservices.\nwholesale customer means a customer that is:\n\n(a) a carrier; or\n\n(b) a service provider.\nwholesaler, when used in relation to a joint functional separation\nundertaking, means a person identified in the undertaking as the\nwholesaler, or one of the wholesalers, for the purposes of the\nundertaking.\nNote:\nSee paragraph 151C(2)(a).\nworker means an individual who is:\n\n(a) an employee; or\n\n(b) a contractor or subcontractor; or\n\n(c) an employee of a contractor or subcontractor.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-32-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-32-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-32-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "442232cd8ec8f8cd0bcfe19d71edf4ec33e1b533f3b7574e8bb37edcaabc1fdd",
      "skos:note": "Definitions for wholesale business unit, customer, wholesaler, worker, and joint functional separation undertaking."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-32",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32 Section 142A",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\nwholesale business unit of a corporation means a business unit by\nwhich the corporation deals with its wholesale customers, and its\nretail business unit, in relation to the supply of local access line\nservices.\nwholesale customer means a customer that is:\n\n(a) a carrier; or\n\n(b) a service provider.\nwholesaler, when used in relation to a joint functional separation\nundertaking, means a person identified in the undertaking as the\nwholesaler, or one of the wholesalers, for the purposes of the\nundertaking.\nNote:\nSee paragraph 151C(2)(a).\nworker means an individual who is:\n\n(a) an employee; or\n\n(b) a contractor or subcontractor; or\n\n(c) an employee of a contractor or subcontractor."
    },
    {
