    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-142c-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "142C(2) Supply of eligible services to be on wholesale basis—lines that",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-142c-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a person (the first person):\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(a) is in a position to exercise control of the line; or\n\n(b) is an associate of a person who is in a position to exercise\ncontrol of the line;\nthe first person must not, on or after the designated commencement\ndate, use the line, either alone or jointly with one or more other\npersons, to supply an eligible service unless the service is supplied\nto:\n\n(c) a carrier; or\n\n(d) a service provider.\nNote:\nFor when a person is in a position to exercise control of a line, see\nsection 155A.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If a person (the first person):\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(a) is in a position to exercise control of the line; or\n\n(b) is an associate of a person who is in a position to exercise\ncontrol of the line;\nthe first person must not, on or after the designated commencement\ndate, use the line, either alone or jointly with one or more other\npersons, to supply an eligible service unless the service is supplied\nto:\n\n(c) a carrier; or\n\n(d) a service provider.\nNote:\nFor when a person is in a position to exercise control of a line, see\nsection 155A.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-142c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
