      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a person (the first person):\n\n(a) is in a position to exercise control of the network; or\n\n(b) is an associate of a person who is in a position to exercise\ncontrol of the network;\nthe first person must not use the line, either alone or jointly with\none or more other persons, to supply an eligible service unless the\nservice is supplied to:\n\n(c) a carrier; or\n\n(d) a service provider.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\nNote:\nFor when a person is in a position to exercise control of a network, see\nsection 155.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If a person (the first person):\n\n(a) is in a position to exercise control of the network; or\n\n(b) is an associate of a person who is in a position to exercise\ncontrol of the network;\nthe first person must not use the line, either alone or jointly with\none or more other persons, to supply an eligible service unless the\nservice is supplied to:\n\n(c) a carrier; or\n\n(d) a service provider.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\nNote:\nFor when a person is in a position to exercise control of a network, see\nsection 155.",
      "values:partOf": {
