      "cml:premiseText": "(5) Examples of grounds for believing as mentioned in subsection (4)",
      "cml:conclusionText": "include: (a) evidence that the wholesale customer or prospective wholesale customer is not creditworthy; and (b) repeated failures by the wholesale customer or prospective wholesale customer to comply with the terms and conditions on which the person supplied eligible services"
    },
