      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "(8) In deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1)\nor (2), the ACCC must have regard to:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(a) whether the determination promotes the long-term interests\nof end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by\nmeans of carriage services; and\n\n(b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under\nsubsection (9); and\n\n(c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) In deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1)\nor (2), the ACCC must have regard to:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(a) whether the determination promotes the long-term interests\nof end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by\nmeans of carriage services; and\n\n(b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under\nsubsection (9); and\n\n(c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a-ss-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "08a43fc1cde251d37016849d2e22a9e1e65186e4baac86e0ad64418f7fca1ef0",
      "skos:note": "Consider long-term interests of end-users and specified matters when making a determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-143a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "143A(8) Class exemptions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1)\nor (2), the ACCC must have regard to:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(a) whether the determination promotes the long-term interests\nof end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by\nmeans of carriage services; and\n\n(b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under\nsubsection (9); and\n\n(c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant."
    },
