    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "143A(10) Class exemptions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-143a-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "(10) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates.",
      "skos:definition": "(10) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
