    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143d-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "143D(9) Publication of list of persons who have elected to be bound by",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-143d-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(9) For the purposes of this section, a project is a building\nredevelopment project if the project involves:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(a) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or more\nbuildings so as to bring into existence one or more building\nunits; and\n\n(b) the making available of any or all of those building units for\nsale or lease.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) For the purposes of this section, a project is a building\nredevelopment project if the project involves:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(a) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or more\nbuildings so as to bring into existence one or more building\nunits; and\n\n(b) the making available of any or all of those building units for\nsale or lease.",
      "values:partOf": {
