          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151b-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "35b2bd32e0de21423b67824425c3a397c7c93b1c645b2d014f06214717a8aa31",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from certain provisions for functional separation undertakings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151B(2) Deemed standard functional separation undertaking",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The following provisions do not apply to a functional separation\nundertaking covered by a determination under subsection (1):\n\n(a) subsections 151A(4) to (8);\n\n(b) section 151N;\n\n(c) section 151P;\n\n(d) section 151Q;\n\n(e) section 151W."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151b-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
