    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151B(5) Deemed standard functional separation undertaking",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151b-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the ACCC\nmust:\n\n(a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the draft determination; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the draft determination within the time limit\nspecified in the notice; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the time limit\nspecified in the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the ACCC\nmust:\n\n(a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the draft determination; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the draft determination within the time limit\nspecified in the notice; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the time limit\nspecified in the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151b-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151b-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0bd4cbb5859611b697391a02355c8da7c2ae8ead618b8df1cd879811c868d42f",
      "skos:note": "Publish notice and consider submissions before making a determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151B(5) Deemed standard functional separation undertaking",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the ACCC\nmust:\n\n(a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\n(i) setting out the draft determination; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the draft determination within the time limit\nspecified in the notice; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the time limit\nspecified in the notice."
    },
