      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If 2 or more persons are corporations, those persons may give a\njoint written undertaking (a joint functional separation\nundertaking) to the ACCC.\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If 2 or more persons are corporations, those persons may give a\njoint written undertaking (a joint functional separation\nundertaking) to the ACCC.\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020",
