    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151C(10) Joint functional separation undertaking",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151c-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(10) The undertaking must provide that a wholesaler will give the\nACCC periodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:\n\n(a) relate to the wholesaler’s compliance with the undertaking;\nand\n\n(b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC.\nNote:\nSee section 151ZJ (self-incrimination).",
      "skos:definition": "(10) The undertaking must provide that a wholesaler will give the\nACCC periodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:\n\n(a) relate to the wholesaler’s compliance with the undertaking;\nand\n\n(b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC.\nNote:\nSee section 151ZJ (self-incrimination).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-10-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-10-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dc9c4fa52983675f912ca01eb428f7eb7e07bf60bbfe88d3bf48cde45bc42504",
      "skos:note": "Wholesaler must provide periodic compliance reports to ACCC.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151c-ss-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151C(10) Joint functional separation undertaking",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(10) The undertaking must provide that a wholesaler will give the\nACCC periodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:\n\n(a) relate to the wholesaler’s compliance with the undertaking;\nand\n\n(b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC.\nNote:\nSee section 151ZJ (self-incrimination)."
    },
