      "values:originalText": "(11) The undertaking must provide that a retailer will give the ACCC\nperiodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:\n\n(a) relate to the retailer’s compliance with the undertaking; and\n\n(b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC.\nNote:\nSee section 151ZJ (self-incrimination).\nCompliance plans",
      "skos:definition": "(11) The undertaking must provide that a retailer will give the ACCC\nperiodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:\n\n(a) relate to the retailer’s compliance with the undertaking; and\n\n(b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC.\nNote:\nSee section 151ZJ (self-incrimination).\nCompliance plans",
