          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151h-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "093259b247b8112a3c766385b84de6ad3d3280e6788032c64b7bf906c1b4a7a8",
      "skos:note": "ACCC must refund fee if refused to consider undertaking and paid a fee."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151h-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151H(3) Serial undertakings",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 57,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\n(a) the ACCC refuses to consider a functional separation\nundertaking under this section; and\n\n(b) a person or persons have paid a fee in relation to the\nundertaking;\nthe ACCC must, on behalf of the Commonwealth, refund the fee."
    },
