    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151m",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151M Renewal of functional separation undertaking",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151m"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a standard functional separation undertaking (the existing\nundertaking) given by a person is in force; and\n\n(b) at least 12 months before the expiry of the existing\nundertaking, the person gives the ACCC another standard\nfunctional separation undertaking;\nthe other undertaking may be expressed to be given by way of\nrenewal of the existing undertaking.\nNote:\nFor acceptance or rejection of the other undertaking, see section 151F.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) a joint functional separation undertaking (the existing\nundertaking) given by 2 or more persons is in force; and\n\n(b) at least 12 months before the expiry of the existing\nundertaking, those persons give another joint functional\nseparation undertaking to the ACCC;\nthe other undertaking may be expressed to be given by way of\nrenewal of the existing undertaking.\nNote 1:\nFor acceptance or rejection of the other undertaking, see section 151F.\nNote 2:\nFor consultation on a decision to accept or reject the other\nundertaking, see section 151G.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a standard functional separation undertaking (the existing\nundertaking) given by a person is in force; and\n\n(b) at least 12 months before the expiry of the existing\nundertaking, the person gives the ACCC another standard\nfunctional separation undertaking;\nthe other undertaking may be expressed to be given by way of\nrenewal of the existing undertaking.\nNote:\nFor acceptance or rejection of the other undertaking, see section 151F.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) a joint functional separation undertaking (the existing\nundertaking) given by 2 or more persons is in force; and\n\n(b) at least 12 months before the expiry of the existing\nundertaking, those persons give another joint functional\nseparation undertaking to the ACCC;\nthe other undertaking may be expressed to be given by way of\nrenewal of the existing undertaking.\nNote 1:\nFor acceptance or rejection of the other undertaking, see section 151F.\nNote 2:\nFor consultation on a decision to accept or reject the other\nundertaking, see section 151G.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151m-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151m-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ce0d28c1b332e6ff76f3435ac6ee3a71185c8c8f687ebcf3cf1771c596189a98"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151m",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151M Renewal of functional separation undertaking",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 61,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a standard functional separation undertaking (the existing\nundertaking) given by a person is in force; and\n\n(b) at least 12 months before the expiry of the existing\nundertaking, the person gives the ACCC another standard\nfunctional separation undertaking;\nthe other undertaking may be expressed to be given by way of\nrenewal of the existing undertaking.\nNote:\nFor acceptance or rejection of the other undertaking, see section 151F.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) a joint functional separation undertaking (the existing\nundertaking) given by 2 or more persons is in force; and\n\n(b) at least 12 months before the expiry of the existing\nundertaking, those persons give another joint functional\nseparation undertaking to the ACCC;\nthe other undertaking may be expressed to be given by way of\nrenewal of the existing undertaking.\nNote 1:\nFor acceptance or rejection of the other undertaking, see section 151F.\nNote 2:\nFor consultation on a decision to accept or reject the other\nundertaking, see section 151G."
    },
