      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "(7) Before making a decision under this section to vary a functional\nseparation undertaking, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(i) setting out the proposed variation; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the proposed variation within the time limit\nspecified in the notice; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the time limit\nspecified in the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) Before making a decision under this section to vary a functional\nseparation undertaking, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(i) setting out the proposed variation; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the proposed variation within the time limit\nspecified in the notice; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the time limit\nspecified in the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151n"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
