          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151n-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151n-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "785d3105b951c01a67c288bdd36a76f6f02d04c3ac177881bbefc8d2cd485670",
      "skos:note": "Publish notice on website and consider submissions before varying functional separation undertaking."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151n-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151N(7) Variation of expiry time of certain functional separation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 61,
      "values:originalText": "(7) Before making a decision under this section to vary a functional\nseparation undertaking, the ACCC must:\n\n(a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(i) setting out the proposed variation; and\n\n(ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC\nabout the proposed variation within the time limit\nspecified in the notice; and\n\n(b) consider any submissions received within the time limit\nspecified in the notice."
    },
