    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151r",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151R Further information about variation of functional separation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151r"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.65",
      "values:originalText": "undertaking\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person gives the ACCC a variation of a standard functional\nseparation undertaking; or\n\n(b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a variation of a joint\nfunctional separation undertaking.\nRequest for further information\n\n(2) The ACCC may request the person or persons to give the ACCC\nfurther information about the variation.\n\n(3) The ACCC may refuse to consider the variation until the person or\npersons give the ACCC the information.\n\n(4) The ACCC may withdraw its request for further information, in\nwhole or in part.",
      "skos:definition": "undertaking\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person gives the ACCC a variation of a standard functional\nseparation undertaking; or\n\n(b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a variation of a joint\nfunctional separation undertaking.\nRequest for further information\n\n(2) The ACCC may request the person or persons to give the ACCC\nfurther information about the variation.\n\n(3) The ACCC may refuse to consider the variation until the person or\npersons give the ACCC the information.\n\n(4) The ACCC may withdraw its request for further information, in\nwhole or in part.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151r-ss-1"
        },
