      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "(6) In calculating the 3-month period referred to in subsection (5),\ndisregard:\n\n(a) a day in the period:\n\n(i) beginning on the day on which the ACCC published the\nvariation under section 151U; and\n\n(ii) ending at the end of the time limit specified by the\nACCC when it published the variation under\nsection 151U; and\n\n(b) if the ACCC has requested further information under\nsection 151R in relation to the variation—a day during any\npart of which the request, or any part of the request, remains\nunfulfilled.\nExtension of decision-making period",
      "skos:definition": "(6) In calculating the 3-month period referred to in subsection (5),\ndisregard:\n\n(a) a day in the period:\n\n(i) beginning on the day on which the ACCC published the\nvariation under section 151U; and\n\n(ii) ending at the end of the time limit specified by the\nACCC when it published the variation under\nsection 151U; and\n\n(b) if the ACCC has requested further information under\nsection 151R in relation to the variation—a day during any\npart of which the request, or any part of the request, remains\nunfulfilled.\nExtension of decision-making period",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151t"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151t-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151t-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b2ece394abbf421d137664af5a1d9dc91855b037100e07d86b0b6eb29c70beb",
      "skos:note": "Disregard certain days when calculating the 3-month period"
    },
