      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "(8) As soon as practicable after the ACCC gives a notice under\nsubsection (7), the ACCC must publish a copy of the notice on the\nACCC’s website.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(8) As soon as practicable after the ACCC gives a notice under\nsubsection (7), the ACCC must publish a copy of the notice on the\nACCC’s website.\n\nSchedule 2  Local access lines\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151t"
      },
