      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(7) If: (a) a joint functional separation undertaking given by 2 or more persons is in force; and (b) the ACCC is satisfied that any of those persons has an unsatisfactory compliance record in relation to functional separation;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the ACCC may, by written notice given to each of those persons, revoke the undertaking."
    },
