      "values:originalText": "(3) A failure to comply with subsection (2) does not affect the validity\nof a revocation of a functional separation undertaking.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A failure to comply with subsection (2) does not affect the validity\nof a revocation of a functional separation undertaking.",
