      "cml:integrityHash": "3e2b4e7bc661e6469c8dfe978230157e1df6b1dccac9e3d6b2c3b7413f532004",
      "skos:note": "Notify ACCC of control change within 10 business days.",
      "dc:description": "Notification in writing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151zb-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151ZB(3) Requirement to notify changes in control of person who gave",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 77,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\n(a) a functional separation undertaking given by a person (the\nfirst person) is in force; and\n\n(b) another person becomes aware that the other person is in a\nposition to exercise control of the first person;\nthe other person must:\n\n(c) notify the ACCC, in writing, of that position; and\n\n(d) do so as soon as practicable, but not later than 10 business\ndays, after becoming so aware.\nNote:\nSee section 154."
    },
