    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151ZC Register of functional separation undertakings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-151zc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACCC is to maintain a Register in which the ACCC includes:\n\n(a) all functional separation undertakings that have been\naccepted by the ACCC (including those that are no longer in\nforce); and\n\n(b) in the case of a functional separation undertaking that, under\nsection 151B, is taken to have been given by a corporation:\n\n(i) the name of the corporation; and\n\n(ii) the date the undertaking came into force; and\n\n(c) all variations of functional separation undertakings.\n\n(2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.\n\n(3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACCC’s\nwebsite.\n\n(4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACCC is to maintain a Register in which the ACCC includes:\n\n(a) all functional separation undertakings that have been\naccepted by the ACCC (including those that are no longer in\nforce); and\n\n(b) in the case of a functional separation undertaking that, under\nsection 151B, is taken to have been given by a corporation:\n\n(i) the name of the corporation; and\n\n(ii) the date the undertaking came into force; and\n\n(c) all variations of functional separation undertakings.\n\n(2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.\n\n(3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACCC’s\nwebsite.\n\n(4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zc-ss-1"
        },
