      "cof:title": "151ZE(3) Enforcement of functional separation undertaking",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Federal Court may, before making an order under this section,\ndirect that notice of the application be given to such persons as it\nthinks fit or be published in such manner as it thinks fit, or both."
    },
