      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Subsection (2) has effect subject to subsection (2B).\n\n(2B) For the purposes of:\n\n(a) section 142C; and\n\n(b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthey relate to a line to which section 142C applies; and\n\n(c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision\nrelates to:\n\n(i) section 142C; or\n\n(ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthat section relates to a line to which section 142C\napplies;\nif a line in a multi-unit building is used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service to a residential customer living in a unit in the\nbuilding:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(d) the line is taken to be a local access line; and\n\n(e) the line is taken to form part of the infrastructure of a\ntelecommunications network.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Subsection (2) has effect subject to subsection (2B).\n\n(2B) For the purposes of:\n\n(a) section 142C; and\n\n(b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthey relate to a line to which section 142C applies; and\n\n(c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision\nrelates to:\n\n(i) section 142C; or\n\n(ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthat section relates to a line to which section 142C\napplies;\nif a line in a multi-unit building is used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service to a residential customer living in a unit in the\nbuilding:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(d) the line is taken to be a local access line; and\n\n(e) the line is taken to form part of the infrastructure of a\ntelecommunications network.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-71-ss-2a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-71-ss-2b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-71",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "71 After subsection 158(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Subsection (2) has effect subject to subsection (2B).\n\n(2B) For the purposes of:\n\n(a) section 142C; and\n\n(b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthey relate to a line to which section 142C applies; and\n\n(c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision\nrelates to:\n\n(i) section 142C; or\n\n(ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthat section relates to a line to which section 142C\napplies;\nif a line in a multi-unit building is used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service to a residential customer living in a unit in the\nbuilding:\n\nLocal access lines  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(d) the line is taken to be a local access line; and\n\n(e) the line is taken to form part of the infrastructure of a\ntelecommunications network."
    },
