    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-158a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "158A Deemed local access lines",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-2-sec-158a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a local access line was in existence immediately before the\ndesignated commencement date; and\n\n(b) the line is extended on or after the designated commencement\ndate;\nthen:\n\n(c) the extension is taken to be a local access line in its own\nright; and\n\n(d) the local access line referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to\nhave come into existence on or after the designated\ncommencement date.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply in determining the meaning of an\nexpression used in:\n\n(a) section 143; or\n\n(b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthey relate to a line to which section 143 applies; or\n\n(c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision\nrelates to:\n\n(i) section 143; or\n\n(ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthat section relates to a line to which section 143\napplies.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a local access line was in existence immediately before the\ndesignated commencement date; and\n\n(b) the line is extended on or after the designated commencement\ndate;\nthen:\n\n(c) the extension is taken to be a local access line in its own\nright; and\n\n(d) the local access line referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to\nhave come into existence on or after the designated\ncommencement date.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply in determining the meaning of an\nexpression used in:\n\n(a) section 143; or\n\n(b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthey relate to a line to which section 143 applies; or\n\n(c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision\nrelates to:\n\n(i) section 143; or\n\n(ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which\nthat section relates to a line to which section 143\napplies.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-158a-ss-1"
        },
        {
