    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360D(2) Interim NBN service area",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360d-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If, during the period:\n\n(a) beginning at the commencement of this section; and\n\n(b) ending immediately before the designated day;\nthere begins to be published on NBN Co’s website a statement to\nthe effect that a particular area in Australia is ready for service,\nNBN Co must:\n\n(c) by written instrument, declare that the area is a provisional\ninterim NBN service area for the purposes of the application\nof this Part before the designated day; and\n\n(d) do so within 10 business days after the end of the month in\nwhich the statement began to be published.\nNote:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If, during the period:\n\n(a) beginning at the commencement of this section; and\n\n(b) ending immediately before the designated day;\nthere begins to be published on NBN Co’s website a statement to\nthe effect that a particular area in Australia is ready for service,\nNBN Co must:\n\n(c) by written instrument, declare that the area is a provisional\ninterim NBN service area for the purposes of the application\nof this Part before the designated day; and\n\n(d) do so within 10 business days after the end of the month in\nwhich the statement began to be published.\nNote:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.",
      "values:partOf": {
