      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, before the commencement of this section, there was published\non NBN Co’s website a statement to the effect that a particular area\nin Australia is ready for service, NBN Co must:\n\n(a) by written instrument, declare that the area is a provisional\ninterim NBN service area for the purposes of the application\nof this Part before the designated day; and\n\n(b) do so within 10 business days after the commencement of\nthis section.\nNote:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\nPublication etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, before the commencement of this section, there was published\non NBN Co’s website a statement to the effect that a particular area\nin Australia is ready for service, NBN Co must:\n\n(a) by written instrument, declare that the area is a provisional\ninterim NBN service area for the purposes of the application\nof this Part before the designated day; and\n\n(b) do so within 10 business days after the commencement of\nthis section.\nNote:\nFor the format of the description of the area, see section 360LA.\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\nPublication etc.",
