      "skos:note": "NBN Co must declare a provisional interim NBN service area within 10 business days after section commencement.",
      "dc:description": "(a) by written instrument, declare that the area is a provisional interim NBN service area for the purposes of the application of this Part before the designated day; and (b) do so within 10 business days after the commencement of this section."
    },
