    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360j",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360J Nominated service area—carrier licence conditions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360j"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "declarations\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if, immediately before the\ncommencement of this section, a carrier licence held by a carrier\nwas subject to a condition under any of the following declarations\nin relation to a development area (within the meaning of the\ndeclaration):\n\n(a) the Carrier Licence Conditions (OptiComm Co Pty Ltd)\nDeclaration 2013;\n\n(b) the Carrier Licence Conditions (Pivit Pty Ltd)\nDeclaration 2013;\n\n(c) the Carrier Licence Conditions (NT Technology Services Pty\nLtd) Declaration 2014;\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "skos:definition": "declarations\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if, immediately before the\ncommencement of this section, a carrier licence held by a carrier\nwas subject to a condition under any of the following declarations\nin relation to a development area (within the meaning of the\ndeclaration):\n\n(a) the Carrier Licence Conditions (OptiComm Co Pty Ltd)\nDeclaration 2013;\n\n(b) the Carrier Licence Conditions (Pivit Pty Ltd)\nDeclaration 2013;\n\n(c) the Carrier Licence Conditions (NT Technology Services Pty\nLtd) Declaration 2014;\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
