    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360v-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360V(3) Rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360v-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.136",
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, a statutory infrastructure provider is not required to\ncomply with a rule under subsection (1) to the extent that the rule\nis inconsistent with an access agreement to which the statutory\ninfrastructure provider is a party, so long as:\n\n(a) the agreement was entered into before the commencement of\nthe rule; and\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(b) the agreement has not been varied after the commencement\nof the rule.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) However, a statutory infrastructure provider is not required to\ncomply with a rule under subsection (1) to the extent that the rule\nis inconsistent with an access agreement to which the statutory\ninfrastructure provider is a party, so long as:\n\n(a) the agreement was entered into before the commencement of\nthe rule; and\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(b) the agreement has not been varied after the commencement\nof the rule.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360v"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
