    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360x",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360X Publication of offer—supply of eligible services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360x"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must publish\non its website:\n\n(a) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of\nascertaining price; and\n\n(b) other terms and conditions;\non which it offers to supply eligible services to carriage service\nproviders in order that the carriage service providers can provide\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must publish\non its website:\n\n(a) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of\nascertaining price; and\n\n(b) other terms and conditions;\non which it offers to supply eligible services to carriage service\nproviders in order that the carriage service providers can provide\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360x-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360x-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c63fe919c59251cb4264e6cbfcd12d90b99993ea271e23eb7b328d9a53e11a20",
      "skos:note": "Publish terms and conditions on website",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360x",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360X Publication of offer—supply of eligible services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 137,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must publish\non its website:\n\n(a) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of\nascertaining price; and\n\n(b) other terms and conditions;\non which it offers to supply eligible services to carriage service\nproviders in order that the carriage service providers can provide\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360x-norm",
