    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360Y Building redevelopment projects etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360y"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.139",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a project is a building redevelopment\nproject if:\n\n(a) the project involves:\n\n(i) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or\nmore buildings so as to bring into existence one or more\nbuilding units; and\n\n(ii) the making available of any or all of those building units\nfor sale or lease; and\n\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (3) are satisfied.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, the area or areas occupied by the\nbuilding or buildings are the project area for the building\nredevelopment project.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(b).\n\n(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a project is a building redevelopment\nproject if:\n\n(a) the project involves:\n\n(i) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or\nmore buildings so as to bring into existence one or more\nbuilding units; and\n\n(ii) the making available of any or all of those building units\nfor sale or lease; and\n\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (3) are satisfied.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, the area or areas occupied by the\nbuilding or buildings are the project area for the building\nredevelopment project.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(b).\n\n(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "692c7f50d3b7e415a2d0e3024541cd7c4a84c248c35b43a4c7ac7736592dfbaf"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360y",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360Y Building redevelopment projects etc.",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 139,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a project is a building redevelopment\nproject if:\n\n(a) the project involves:\n\n(i) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or\nmore buildings so as to bring into existence one or more\nbuilding units; and\n\n(ii) the making available of any or all of those building units\nfor sale or lease; and\n\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in an instrument under\nsubsection (3) are satisfied.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, the area or areas occupied by the\nbuilding or buildings are the project area for the building\nredevelopment project.\n\n(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for\nthe purposes of paragraph (1)(b).\n\n(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc."
    },
