    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360Y(4) Building redevelopment projects etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360y-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.139",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9fa1079225cdbaaede71ca74c9bd55b153a138e209ef2d38cbf3e0d0bc6e1eda",
      "skos:note": "It is immaterial whether the project has been, is being, or will be implemented in stages; or different elements of the project have been, are being, or will be carried out by different persons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-3-sec-360y-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360Y(4) Building redevelopment projects etc.",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 139,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:\n\n(a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in\nstages; or\n\n(b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will\nbe, carried out by different persons; or\n\nSchedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc."
    },
