        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-76a-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-76a-ss-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-76a-ss-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2baa90ddf7a545ff35ba649ff9964e8a7f3825d77b19b1624f71581f80c46a31"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-76a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "76A Local access line",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 152,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a local access line is a line that is part\nof the infrastructure of a local access network.\n\n(2) However, a line does not form part of a local access line to the\nextent that the line is on the customer side of the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) has effect subject to subsection (4).\n\n(4) For the purposes of this Part, if a line in a multi-unit building is\nused to supply a carriage service to a unit in the building, the line is\ntaken to be a local access line.\n\n(5) For the purposes of this section, the boundary of a\ntelecommunications network is to be determined in the same\nmanner in which it is determined under section 22 for the purposes\nof sections 20, 21 and 30.\n\n(6) For the purposes of this section, local access network has the\nmeaning generally accepted within the telecommunications\nindustry."
    },
