      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part (other than section 85), the 6-month\nperiod beginning on the designated start date is taken to be a\nfinancial year.\n\nFunding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020"
