      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(7) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in:\n\n(a) the short title of the Telecommunications (Regional\nBroadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020; or\n\n(b) the name of the Regional Broadband Scheme Special\nAccount; or\n\n(c) section 92A;\ndoes not limit subsection (1) of this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in:\n\n(a) the short title of the Telecommunications (Regional\nBroadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020; or\n\n(b) the name of the Regional Broadband Scheme Special\nAccount; or\n\n(c) section 92A;\ndoes not limit subsection (1) of this section.",
