      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(9) Despite subsection (6), a determination under subsection (2) has no\neffect to the extent to which it overrides a term or condition:\n\n(a) set out in an agreement under section 81; and\n\n(b) that gives the grant recipient a right to adjustment of payment\nfor a change in the services, facilities or customer equipment\nto be supplied by the grant recipient in accordance with the\nterms and conditions of the grant.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) Despite subsection (6), a determination under subsection (2) has no\neffect to the extent to which it overrides a term or condition:\n\n(a) set out in an agreement under section 81; and\n\n(b) that gives the grant recipient a right to adjustment of payment\nfor a change in the services, facilities or customer equipment\nto be supplied by the grant recipient in accordance with the\nterms and conditions of the grant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-82"
