          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-82-ss-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "faa1256a98e9edf76a0e455ebe13dc45bc962efad8790d7a28bc4f8a0e114ff8",
      "skos:note": "Grant recipient has a right to adjustment of payment for changes in services, facilities or customer equipment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-82-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "82(9) Condition about compliance with Ministerial determination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 157,
      "values:originalText": "(9) Despite subsection (6), a determination under subsection (2) has no\neffect to the extent to which it overrides a term or condition:\n\n(a) set out in an agreement under section 81; and\n\n(b) that gives the grant recipient a right to adjustment of payment\nfor a change in the services, facilities or customer equipment\nto be supplied by the grant recipient in accordance with the\nterms and conditions of the grant."
    },
