    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-83",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "83 Secretary has powers etc. of the Commonwealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-83"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has all the rights,\nresponsibilities, duties and powers of the Commonwealth in\nrelation to the Commonwealth’s capacity as:\n\n(a) a party to a contract entered into under section 80; or\n\n(b) the grantor of a grant made under section 80.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1):\n\n(a) an amount payable by the Commonwealth under a section 80\ncontract is to be paid by the Secretary on behalf of the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(b) an amount payable to the Commonwealth under a section 80\ncontract is to be paid to the Secretary on behalf of the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(c) a section 80 grant is to be paid by the Secretary on behalf of\nthe Commonwealth; and\n\n(d) an amount payable to the Commonwealth by way of the\nrepayment of the whole or a part of a section 80 grant is to be\npaid to the Secretary on behalf of the Commonwealth; and\n\n(e) the Secretary may institute an action or proceeding on behalf\nof the Commonwealth in relation to a matter that concerns:\n\n(i) a section 80 contract; or\n\n(ii) a section 80 grant.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has all the rights,\nresponsibilities, duties and powers of the Commonwealth in\nrelation to the Commonwealth’s capacity as:\n\n(a) a party to a contract entered into under section 80; or\n\n(b) the grantor of a grant made under section 80.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1):\n\n(a) an amount payable by the Commonwealth under a section 80\ncontract is to be paid by the Secretary on behalf of the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(b) an amount payable to the Commonwealth under a section 80\ncontract is to be paid to the Secretary on behalf of the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(c) a section 80 grant is to be paid by the Secretary on behalf of\nthe Commonwealth; and\n\n(d) an amount payable to the Commonwealth by way of the\nrepayment of the whole or a part of a section 80 grant is to be\npaid to the Secretary on behalf of the Commonwealth; and\n\n(e) the Secretary may institute an action or proceeding on behalf\nof the Commonwealth in relation to a matter that concerns:\n\n(i) a section 80 contract; or\n\n(ii) a section 80 grant.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-83-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-83-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6c6412361bf6c2f12ee4d8aa67332e7b793e0cb2018ffe284d09988d306a9f94"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-83",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "83 Secretary has powers etc. of the Commonwealth",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 159,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has all the rights,\nresponsibilities, duties and powers of the Commonwealth in\nrelation to the Commonwealth’s capacity as:\n\n(a) a party to a contract entered into under section 80; or\n\n(b) the grantor of a grant made under section 80.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1):\n\n(a) an amount payable by the Commonwealth under a section 80\ncontract is to be paid by the Secretary on behalf of the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(b) an amount payable to the Commonwealth under a section 80\ncontract is to be paid to the Secretary on behalf of the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(c) a section 80 grant is to be paid by the Secretary on behalf of\nthe Commonwealth; and\n\n(d) an amount payable to the Commonwealth by way of the\nrepayment of the whole or a part of a section 80 grant is to be\npaid to the Secretary on behalf of the Commonwealth; and\n\n(e) the Secretary may institute an action or proceeding on behalf\nof the Commonwealth in relation to a matter that concerns:\n\n(i) a section 80 contract; or\n\n(ii) a section 80 grant."
    },
