    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95(3) Exempt premises—small networks",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-95-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.167",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "aaa6bab434ed4c57caa977dff9c635630e9965fbcf684d930f7e8945b11294d3",
      "skos:note": "Person with control and associates is part of an associated group."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-95-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95(3) Exempt premises—small networks",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 167,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates."
    },
