      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.173",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A contravention of subsection (1), (1A), (2), (4) or (4A) does not\naffect the validity of any transaction.\nScheme",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A contravention of subsection (1), (1A), (2), (4) or (4A) does not\naffect the validity of any transaction.\nScheme",
