      "cml:integrityHash": "cef32c677bcd9ffb4ee93657f4212d2e0342a19f44e92b81d37b0e1584a5f46d",
      "skos:note": "Application must be in writing and in a form approved by the Secretary.",
      "dc:description": "Information specified in rules made under subsection (9)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-98-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "98(2) Charge offset certificate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 175,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An application under subsection (1) must:\n\n(a) be in writing; and\n\n(b) be in a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and\n\n(c) be accompanied by such information as is specified in rules\nmade under subsection (9).\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\nIssue of certificate"
    },
