      "cml:premiseText": "(i) did not know; and (ii) could not, with reasonable diligence, have ascertained that the premises are not potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for the month;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the premises are taken to be potentially concessional."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-5-logic-deontic-6",
