      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) particular premises are reported as potentially concessional premises in relation to the person for a month;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the state must ensure that the premises are reported as potentially concessional."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "100(6) Reporting obligations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-100-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.178",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) the report relates to:\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(i) the first eligible financial year; or\n\n(ii) the second eligible financial year; or\n\n(iii) the third eligible financial year; or\n\n(iv) the fourth eligible financial year; or\n\n(v) the fifth eligible financial year; and\n\n(b) during the whole or a part of a month in the eligible financial\nyear, the person was the controller of an associated group;\nthe report must:\n\n(c) set out a statement to that effect; and\n\n(d) identify each of the members of the associated group; and\n\n(e) set out the circumstances that resulted in the person being the\ncontroller of the associated group.\nAssociated group",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If:\n\n(a) the report relates to:\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(i) the first eligible financial year; or\n\n(ii) the second eligible financial year; or\n\n(iii) the third eligible financial year; or\n\n(iv) the fourth eligible financial year; or\n\n(v) the fifth eligible financial year; and\n\n(b) during the whole or a part of a month in the eligible financial\nyear, the person was the controller of an associated group;\nthe report must:\n\n(c) set out a statement to that effect; and\n\n(d) identify each of the members of the associated group; and\n\n(e) set out the circumstances that resulted in the person being the\ncontroller of the associated group.\nAssociated group",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b57b9702452006a547eaa6745c6905af8b7ca63fc2438fc69763c31c81e95c7b",
      "skos:note": "Report must be provided by the controller of an associated group during a part of an eligible financial year.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-100-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100(6) Reporting obligations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 178,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) the report relates to:\n\nSchedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020\n\n(i) the first eligible financial year; or\n\n(ii) the second eligible financial year; or\n\n(iii) the third eligible financial year; or\n\n(iv) the fourth eligible financial year; or\n\n(v) the fifth eligible financial year; and\n\n(b) during the whole or a part of a month in the eligible financial\nyear, the person was the controller of an associated group;\nthe report must:\n\n(c) set out a statement to that effect; and\n\n(d) identify each of the members of the associated group; and\n\n(e) set out the circumstances that resulted in the person being the\ncontroller of the associated group.\nAssociated group"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
