    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "100(7) Reporting obligations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-100-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.178",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates; and\n\n(e) the person is the controller of the associated group.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates; and\n\n(e) the person is the controller of the associated group.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f3d28a11a819d38b415cf3c1021349d5ebee7fd19cf4fca84780dce29d08e70f",
      "skos:note": "Person must report control of local access line or telecommunications network if they have associates."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-100-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100(7) Reporting obligations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 178,
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:\n\n(a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:\n\n(i) a local access line; or\n\n(ii) a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the person has one or more associates;\nthen:\n\n(c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and\n\n(d) the associated group consists of the person and those\nassociates; and\n\n(e) the person is the controller of the associated group."
    },
    {
