      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.184",
      "values:originalText": "(14) For the purposes of this section, the standard due date for a\nfinancial year is:\n\n(a) 31 December next following the financial year; or\n\n(b) if:\n\n(i) a later day is ascertained in accordance with a\ndetermination made under subsection (15); and\n\n(ii) the day ascertained in accordance with the\ndetermination is not later than 28 February next\nfollowing the financial year;\n\nthe day ascertained in accordance with the determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(14) For the purposes of this section, the standard due date for a\nfinancial year is:\n\n(a) 31 December next following the financial year; or\n\n(b) if:\n\n(i) a later day is ascertained in accordance with a\ndetermination made under subsection (15); and\n\n(ii) the day ascertained in accordance with the\ndetermination is not later than 28 February next\nfollowing the financial year;\n\nthe day ascertained in accordance with the determination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102c-ss-14-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "50b7c9c2abd240150cb9795e036e11c266ec1645d4a52e558503cec2c105b930",
      "skos:note": "Determines standard due date for financial year based on determination made under subsection (15)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-102c-ss-14",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "102C(14) ACMA may accept statements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 184,
      "values:originalText": "(14) For the purposes of this section, the standard due date for a\nfinancial year is:\n\n(a) 31 December next following the financial year; or\n\n(b) if:\n\n(i) a later day is ascertained in accordance with a\ndetermination made under subsection (15); and\n\n(ii) the day ascertained in accordance with the\ndetermination is not later than 28 February next\nfollowing the financial year;\n\nthe day ascertained in accordance with the determination."
    },
