    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-4-sec-102n-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "102N(5) Late payment penalty",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 188,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Late payment penalty:\n\n(a) is a debt due to the ACMA on behalf of the Commonwealth;\nand\n\n(b) may be recovered by the ACMA, on behalf of the\nCommonwealth, in:\n\n(i) the Federal Court; or\n\n(ii) the Federal Circuit Court; or\n\nFunding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4\n\nNo. 47, 2020\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\n\n(iii) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in\nrelation to the matter."
    },
