      "cof:title": "102ZC(3) Register of Grants for the Funding of Fixed Wireless",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 196,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Register of Grants for the Funding of Fixed Wireless\nBroadband and Satellite Broadband is to be made available for\ninspection on the Department’s website."
    },
