      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.203",
      "values:originalText": "In determining the meaning of the expression capable when used\nin:\n\n(a) a provision of this Act (other than this Part); or\n\n(b) the Telecommunications Act 1997;\ndisregard the expression technically capable when used in\nsection 76AA.\n\nSchedule 5  NBN Co transparency\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020",
      "skos:definition": "In determining the meaning of the expression capable when used\nin:\n\n(a) a provision of this Act (other than this Part); or\n\n(b) the Telecommunications Act 1997;\ndisregard the expression technically capable when used in\nsection 76AA.\n\nSchedule 5  NBN Co transparency\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and\nConsumer) Act 2020\nNo. 47, 2020",
