      "skos:note": "Must arrange for mapping data to be made available on the National Map website."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020#sch-5-sec-98b-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "98B(7) Mapping data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 204,
      "values:originalText": "(7) Before the end of the 60-day period beginning when this section\ncommences, the Secretary must arrange for mapping data provided\nunder subsection (1) to be made available on the National Map\nwebsite (https://nationalmap.gov.au) in colour-coded format."
    },
